Package: ward
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, libglib2.0-bin, pkexec, polkitd, desktop-file-utils, hicolor-icon-theme
Suggests: firewalld | ufw
Description: Native GTK firewall manager for UFW and firewalld
 Manage firewall status, rules, and port exceptions using a native
 GTK4/libadwaita interface. UFW operations use a scoped PolicyKit helper;
 firewalld operations use its system D-Bus API.
 Installing Ward does not install, enable, disable, or switch firewall backends.
